      "id": "github:1172934784",
      "name": "Entity Compliance Tracker",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "自托管的法律实体合规管理 Web 应用：集中登记公司/子公司实体（管辖地、类型、注册代理、董事高管、良好存续状态），按实体维护申报类型、截止日与 pending/filed/overdue 状态，提供组合级合规日历、逾期提醒与实体文件归档，MIT 许可。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/noamrazbuilds/entity-compliance-tracker",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/noamrazbuilds/entity-compliance-tracker",
      "github_repository_id": 1172934784,
      "license": "MIT",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/entity-compliance-tracker/main/LICENSE",
      "license_review": {
        "reviewer": "OpenDesign collector (DeepSeek V4.1 Flash), unit 077",
        "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noamrazbuilds/entity-compliance-tracker/main/LICENSE",
        "spdx_id": "MIT",
        "scope": "repository",
        "rationale": "快照为完整 MIT 许可证正文（Copyright (c) 2026 Noam Raz and Pleasant Secret Labs），含授权条款与免责声明，无附加限制或商业版拆分条款；仓库元数据与 LICENSE 文件一致标注 MIT。"
      },
      "features": [
        "实体登记册：名称、管辖地、实体类型、成立日期、注册代理、董事/高管、治理文件与良好存续状态",
        "合规日历：跨实体的申报截止日列表/日历视图，按逾期、临近、正常分级",
        "组合仪表盘：实体总数、即将到期、逾期项、良好存续比例及按管辖地/类型统计",
        "申报生命周期：pending → filed 状态、filed_date 记录、逾期状态自动置为 overdue",
        "到期提醒：SMTP 邮件与 Slack webhook，可按实体覆盖提醒间隔并去重",
        "股权结构图：D3.js 可折叠组织树，展示持股比例关系"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "本地一键脚本 start.sh / start.bat（FastAPI + Streamlit，默认 http://localhost:8501）",
        "Docker Compose 自托管（前端 8501、API 8000）",
        "README 提供 Railway 一键云部署路径；本次未部署或运行"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Python / FastAPI",
        "SQLAlchemy",
        "Streamlit",
        "D3.js",
        "Docker Compose"
      ],
